$date 2026-11-12T10:08:51 $end
$version fda debug_core (brief 50A) $end
$comment First write 3 to COUNT. Then capture count, win_wr and the shell's ADDR byte when the shell writes the COUNT register (win_wr is 1 and addr is 0x80), 16 cycles before and 32 after. The write that triggers it puts 0x1234 in COUNT. Afterwards read COUNT back. $end
$timescale 10000 ps $end
$scope module capture $end
$var wire 1 ! win_wr $end
$var wire 8 " addr $end
$var wire 16 # count $end
$var wire 1 $ TRIGGER $end
$upscope $end
$enddefinitions $end
#0
0!
b10000000 "
b11 #
0$
#16
1!
1$
#17
0!
b1001000110100 #
0$
#1024
